ion  all that we should know is payne learned  his lesson by fleeing  getting hammered to the ground and even  being thrown into a mountain  horizontally until his legs stuck  out thankfully fourth hokage stepped  into the game and calmed down his angry  son  or naruto shippuden's episode count  would have been way  [Music]  lower  coming up next is our shinigami taking  things to the next level when ichigo  transforms into avasto lord  in bleach okay let's admit it ichigo  took his fair share of beatings in the  first few arcs of the anime thus the  writing had to survive through a pretty  basic formula  the bad guy kicks ichigo's ass and he  pulls up a power-up and uses the uno  reverse card  in this case it was his second round  against okiyora and he desperately  needed a power-up to take down this  espada  turns out orihime's words may be the  trigger in this case  they say screams of love can bring you  back from the dead but ichigo  literally proves this by awakening in  his new form with the resolve to protect  orihime  the next stuff that happened well no  surprise there a white-faced espada  learned the lesson of underestimating  random people who tried to attack the  aran car  in terms of character design i like to  say this is ichigo's coolest  transformation to date  [Music]  coming in at number three is goku's  ultra instinct  in dragon ball at times even i was  surprised how this show went from  simple martial arts to fights between  gods but hey with each transition we got  a new transformation  goku's ultra instinct separates his  conscience from his body  giving him more flexibility and agility  while using skills of martial art combat  needless to say this isn't what you  would achieve in your yoga meditation  session  since it's difficult to master the one  who masters it would get the power to  swat down even the most powerful gods in  the universe  and this time the guy to earn that swot  was a member of the pride troopers  jiren was considered as one of the  strongest mortals in the multiverse but  needless to say  he wasn't the main character of the show  so it was time to take a back seat it  was sad to see goku lose his power due  to the forms in perfect state but let's  give the guy  a position on our list because this is  about epic transformations  and not about victories  isn't the only one who was awarded with  a transformation because of pain  the literal pain i mean because you've  got that one level higher with the  transformation of  gone kind's death triggered all the  guilt and sorrow gone's been hiding  inside him and these personified by  transforming gone into a more adult self  in truth this was because of the massive  amounts of men stored in gohan's body  and when all the stored energy was  released  it wasn't something pretty gone's  unstable mind made a contract as his  conscience had completely broken down  and the ultimate price was paid his life  force itself his future  and all his potential pito learned what  every anime villain learned over time  never to underestimate main characters  who can pull a power up and he learned  this the hard way  and by hard way i mean getting kicked up  to the sky and then being punched with  an immensely powerful punch the downside  of this transformation is that it could  have resulted in guns near death  hunter hunt is known for its unique  power system with the give and take  philosophy so it's not a surprise that  gone had to survive a long time in a  hospital bed as a repercussion  foreign  attack on titan's known for its twist  and i made a whole video to prove that  point  but who thought that the annoying main  hero of the first season would turn out  to be the villain  aaron pulls up a transformation one  notch lower from tetsuo  as he doesn't destroy the world but  massacres an entire city  we all knew it was aaron when the anime  started giving more screen time to the  hobo in the mental hospital but let's  admit that rhino was the most surprised  when his good old friend came to say  hello but this handshake wasn't a  friendly greeting because as one aldian  declared war on parodies  another ldm brought that war right into  the main city as he brutally went on a  killing spree in search of the warhammer  titan with the anime taking a drastic  turn  you can surely expect a wild ride from  this season and since this  transformation resulted in turning a man  vs monster show into one of the best  anime storylines ever told  this definitely deserves the number one  spot on our list  so there goes my favorite 10 epic mc  transformations do you agree with this  list or is there something that i missed  don't be afraid to raise your voice in  the comments if you enjoyed the video  leave a like  and if you aren't a regular watcher of  our channel then make sure to subscribe  for more anime content like this  with that said we're done with today's  content anime fans i'll be seeing you in  the next video

